# Starfall Invocation: "Gift a card. Destroy all creatures. If the gift was promised, return a creature card put into your
# graveyard this way to the battlefield under your control." Bot1 has a Memnite and an Ornithopter, Bot2 a Phyrexian Walker. Cast
# promising the gift on turn 3, Bot2 draws a card first, then all three creatures die. Bot1 chooses between its own two: Bot2's
# Walker (in Bot2's graveyard) is refused, and the Ornithopter comes back under Bot1's control, the Memnite staying dead.

